# xclock startup smoke test - validates that the analog dial maps and
# paints at least one non-blank pixel through the libXaw + libXt + libX11
# compat stack. Drives the XawSimple widget + Clock private widget class
# plus the per-second XtAppAddTimeOut redraw cycle.
delay 1500
wait-window "xclock|XClock" 5000
delay 1000
screenshot initial
assert-image initial common-visible.json
assert-image initial xclock-dial.json
